  "description": "<h4 data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"192\"><strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"197\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"685\" data-start=\"225\">True Femme Collective is a <strong data-end=\"290\" data-start=\"252\">gentle, plant-based skincare brand</strong> designed for women who prioritize clean beauty, transparency, and effectiveness. Our mission is to create skincare that <strong data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"411\">nurtures the skin throughout the natural changes of her cycle</strong>, ensuring balance, hydration, and support during every phase. We believe in honesty, sustainability, and self-care rituals that empower women to feel beautiful in their skin&mdash;no matter what stage they&rsquo;re in.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"687\"><strong data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"692\"></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"687\"><strong data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"692\">Product Description:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"1274\" data-start=\"721\">Our skincare line is intentionally formulated to <strong data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"770\">support the skin through hormonal fluctuations</strong>. Whether it&rsquo;s increased sensitivity, dryness, breakouts, or dullness, our products work in harmony with her body&rsquo;s natural rhythms. Using <strong data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"959\">high-quality botanical extracts, nourishing oils, and active ingredients</strong>, our formulation adapts to <strong data-end=\"1098\" data-start=\"1063\">keep skin healthy and resilient</strong> at every phase. Free from synthetic fragrances, parabens, and harmful additives, our products provide <strong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1201\">pure and effective skincare solutions for every stage of her cycle</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1316\" data-start=\"1276\"><strong data-end=\"1314\" data-start=\"1281\"></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1316\" data-start=\"1276\"><strong data-end=\"1314\" data-start=\"1281\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1898\" data-start=\"1317\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1432\" data-start=\"1317\"><strong data-end=\"1348\" data-start=\"1319\">Cycle-Supportive Skincare</strong> &ndash; Thoughtfully crafted formulas that <strong data-end=\"1429\" data-start=\"1386\">nourish the skin during hormonal shifts</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1574\" data-start=\"1433\"><strong data-end=\"1456\" data-start=\"1435\">Full Transparency</strong> &ndash; We disclose every ingredient and its purpose, ensuring customers know exactly what they&rsquo;re putting on their skin.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1671\" data-start=\"1575\"><strong data-end=\"1601\" data-start=\"1577\">Gentle Yet Effective</strong> &ndash; Our plant-based formulas deliver real results without irritation.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1775\" data-start=\"1672\"><strong data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1674\">Eco-Conscious &amp; Ethical</strong> &ndash; Sustainable packaging, cruelty-free, and made with clean ingredients.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1898\" data-start=\"1776\"><strong data-end=\"1807\" data-start=\"1778\">Trusted by Women Who Care</strong> &ndash; Backed by glowing customer reviews and a growing community that values mindful beauty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1900\"><strong data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1905\"></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1900\"><strong data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1905\">Payment Terms:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2198\" data-start=\"1928\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2003\" data-start=\"1928\">Competitive <strong data-end=\"1961\" data-start=\"1942\">10% commission</strong> per sale through our affiliate program.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2046\" data-start=\"2004\">Bonuses for top-performing affiliates.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2047\">Payments made <strong data-end=\"2086\" data-start=\"2063\">bi-weekly</strong>&nbsp;via <strong data-end=\"2123\" data-start=\"2091\">ACH Transfer</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2198\" data-start=\"2127\">Personalized discount codes for your audience to boost conversions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2231\" data-start=\"2200\"><strong data-end=\"2229\" data-start=\"2205\"></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2231\" data-start=\"2200\"><strong data-end=\"2229\" data-start=\"2205\">Other Information:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2498\" data-start=\"2232\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2326\" data-start=\"2232\">Affiliates receive <strong data-end=\"2297\" data-start=\"2253\">exclusive access to new product launches</strong> and early-bird promotions.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2429\" data-start=\"2327\">We provide <strong data-end=\"2363\" data-start=\"2340\">marketing materials</strong> (images, captions, and content ideas) to make sharing seamless.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2498\" data-start=\"2430\">Dedicated support to help you maximize your earnings and impact.</li>\r\n</ul>",
